[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23704.948, "timestamp": "06:35:04", "text": "我們開始玩了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23706.788, "timestamp": "06:35:06", "text": "。去你的，Gro。去你的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23708.708, "timestamp": "06:35:08", "text": "我的天，Dota。是啊，每次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23714.628, "timestamp": "06:35:14", "text": "我邀請他們玩Dota的時候，他們總是會說：「哎呀，Alexir，你居然玩Dota。」你玩手機遊戲。 「等等，呃，等一下。我需要先設定一下遊戲。它是全螢幕的。我只有一個螢幕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23721.67, "timestamp": "06:35:21", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23723.67, "timestamp": "06:35:23", "text": "我……等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23730.948, "timestamp": "06:35:30", "text": "，沒有這個選項。等等，什麼沒有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23734.708, "timestamp": "06:35:34", "text": "？哦，你點擊……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23736.948, "timestamp": "06:35:36", "text": "點擊更多設定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23739.51, "timestamp": "06:35:39", "text": "。呃，在那裡。嗯，主音量。我們把它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23741.59, "timestamp": "06:35:41", "text": "調低一點，大概……等等，沒有這個選項"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23744.23, "timestamp": "06:35:44", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23759.11, "timestamp": "06:35:59", "text": "模糊。 好的。 Alt+Enter。應該可以了。多聊天資訊。玩。 我們永遠不會玩那個LOL山寨遊戲。遊的人是誰？ ygen"}]